      "q_source": "stage2_saved_hidden_states[19]",
      "step_number": 2,
      "text": "Step 2: Determine the coordinates of points based on the given information.\n- Place point \\(C\\) at the origin \\((0,0)\\).\n- Point \\(D\\) will be at \\((3,0)\\) since \\(CD = 3\\).\n- Point \\(E\\) will be at \\((6,3)\\) because \\(CDEG\\) is a square and \\(CD = 3\\).\n- Point \\(G\\) will be at \\((3,3)\\).",
      "z": -0.5139000612320168
    },
    {
      "aligned_char_end": 760,
      "boundary_aligned_back": true,
      "char_end": 762,
